egin{aligned}f(D) & ={D}^{2}-4I \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]-4[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4-4 & 0+0 \\\\ 0+0 & 4-4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130684/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130684"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection/54f122bfa7671d40a8e1d8157d90868e8d7efe8435c3792beeab132242149bfb" :answer/id #uuid "b7571ea9-2826-5359-b120-3769ff804141" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection/5f95d7c49bd04e9e8ed8712fa1264e6c503ae834f7106b12fcd33ad31cbe2a8e" :answer/id #uuid "198b4223-2a24-5ab5-8230-0222934b6ea6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection/ab3041ceaca0a2b4fc5592c03aa23efaf36d91a316d7d777277bf5b475be6fff" :answer/id #uuid "bf08239f-1d68-5160-ad5b-0e1fb6f3d9c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -6\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" :answer/id #uuid "a841a8ed-ad3e-5b11-ade8-a0f28fe88f75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection/a19b1d96c8d7fe06c37e0531ccdb625374f7dd3a6df3f79268c07a48de65e992" :answer/id #uuid "e84f2c60-6a6d-508b-b60d-0a9965461e17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d245895a-81d2-5c09-98e5-29d373f826a0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130687/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" :answer-field/choices ["q-130687/selection/54f122bfa7671d40a8e1d8157d90868e8d7efe8435c3792beeab132242149bfb" "q-130687/selection/5f95d7c49bd04e9e8ed8712fa1264e6c503ae834f7106b12fcd33ad31cbe2a8e" "q-130687/selection/ab3041ceaca0a2b4fc5592c03aa23efaf36d91a316d7d777277bf5b475be6fff" "q-130687/selection/e93a168901e1ff546ab13ba78724c428c5a9409cc7adc5e8d69736f6401c2be8" "q-130687/selection/a19b1d96c8d7fe06c37e0531ccdb625374f7dd3a6df3f79268c07a48de65e992"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130687" :question/id #uuid "6097bb1d-9d7a-56b4-9d4d-09d460a9e165" :question/math-academy-id "q-130687" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $C=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}].$ Find $f(C)$ if $f(X)={X}^{2}-X+5.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & ={X}^{2}-X+5 \\\\  & ={X}^{2}-X+5I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(C)={C}^{2}-C+5I.$\n\nLet's calculate ${C}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}^{2} & =C\\cdot C \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(C):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(C) & ={C}^{2}-C+5I \\\\  & =C-C+5I \\\\  & =5I \\\\  & =5[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130687/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/